title: "Power Platform Logging Framework"
abstract: "An open-source, configurable logging framework for Microsoft Power Platform (Power Apps, Power Automate, Power Pages, model-driven apps and Dataverse plug-ins) that stores logs in Dataverse or SharePoint from one schema."
